### Adrian Boyer-Paulet

Math at Yale ('30). Interested in arithmetic dynamics, combinatorics, and quantitative finance.

**[prime-powered](https://github.com/adrianboyer/prime-powered)** — a computational companion I'm building to my own research paper on prime-powered images in dynamical semigroups ([arXiv:2510.10310](https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.10310), accepted at *Proc. Amer. Math. Soc. Ser. B*). In progress.

More going up as I build it.

Currently: intensive linear algebra, Bayesian statistics.
